{"articleNo":"202006","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=202006&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2019년도 쌍용곰두리장학생 지원신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.12.20","hit":"4293","attachments":[{"name":"쌍용곰두리장학생 지원신청 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=202006&attachNo=6354"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">장학금을 신청할 학생은 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2019.1.16(수)까지 학생처(본관1층)으로 오시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​→ 1.18.(금)까지 장학생 지원신청서가 한국장애인개발원에 도착해야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong>2019년도 쌍용곰두리장학생 지원신청 안내</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2019년 한국장애인개발원에서 선발하는 쌍용곰두리장학생 모집에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 공지하오니 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">1. 지원기간 :&nbsp;2019.1.7.(월)~1.18.(금)</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">2.&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">선발안내문 : 붙임 참조</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2018. 12.</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong>학 생 처</strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">​</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">​</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span>"}
